'' A test that ends the program -- 'end 7', or a null read under -exx (runtime error 7) -- is
'' reported CRASHED with its exit code, and the run goes on with the next test (testrun.tiko).
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
'' ENV: TIKO_MODCACHE=build/.ttc/cache
'' ENV: TIKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' CLEAN: build/.ttc
'' COPY: tests/driver/src/test-crash => build/.ttc/proj
'' ARGS: test -target windows-x86_64 build/.ttc/proj
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: test first passes ... ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: test ends the program ... CRASHED (exit code 7)
'' EXPECT-OUT: null pointer access
'' EXPECT-OUT: test dereferences null ... CRASHED (exit code 7)
'' EXPECT-OUT: test last passes ... ok
'' EXPECT-OUT: test result: FAILED. 2 passed; 0 failed; 2 crashed; 0 timed out; 0 skipped
